<title>PORTUGAL: BCP/BPA issues 4.5 bln esc PSI-20 bonds.</title>
<headline>BCP/BPA issues 4.5 bln esc PSI-20 bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Comercial Portugues/Banco Portugues do Atlantico is issuing 4.5 billion escudos of five-year PSI-20 capital guaranteed bonds, aimed at small investors, said Banco Cisf, leader of the operation.</p>
<p>&quot;The PSI-20 capital guaranteed bonds provide a return that reflects the PSI-20 share index during the five-year period of the loan and take advantage of the favourable conditions in the share market,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>The issue date is March 7, 1997.</p>
<p>The PSI-20 is an index of 20 leading Portuguese shares.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
